Source: rk3588-camera-dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms, dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/peyton-howe/ubuntu-image-builder

Package: rk3588-camera-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-virtual | linux-headers-arm64
Description: DKMS drivers for RK3588 cameras (IMX708, rkisp2)
 Out-of-tree modules extracted from the ubuntu-image-builder mainline
 camera patch series: the IMX708 sensor driver and the rkisp2 ISP driver.
 The Samsung DCPHY CSI-RX replacement is staged in the source tree but not
 built yet.
 .
 Headers are only recommended: the image build installs headers matching
 each installed kernel, and requiring the linux-headers-generic
 metapackage made apt pull in the archive's newest kernel as well.
